001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    SQUOTUPD.
001300 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.  JULY  l987.
001500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001700*REMARKS.
001800*D QUOTE UPDATE PROGRAM-UPDATES BY QUOTE, VENDOR, OR CODE
      *C     5/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C     5/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     CHANGED REFERENCES FOR COPYCSIS/COPYMMIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C
      *C     9/09/96  WL   MCINTYRE
      *C     MAKE REVISIONS FOR YEAR 2000 CAPATABILITY
      *C
      *C     9/24/96  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     MADE REVISIONS TO CORRECT END-OF-FILE SCROLLING.
      *C
      *C    17JUL1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C    REVISED TO PROVIDE FOR THE POSSIBILITY THAT
      *C    FIELD VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT (VEN-DSCT, VEN-DSCT1,
      *C    VEN-DSCT2) MAY CONTAIN NON-NUMERIC DATA.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
001900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
