       849-EXIT.  EXIT.

       850-BACK-QUOTE.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD, NO-NEXT.
           READ DVENDITM3 PRIOR RECORD INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
                   MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF QUOTENUM OF DVENDITM-REC3 NOT = QUOTE-ARG
               MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
               ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
               MOVE IO-REL-NO TO RELATIVE-KEY.

      *-----  IF READ TOOK POINTER BEYOND BEGINNING OF FILE
      *-----  DO READ FIRST TO BRING POINTER BACK.

           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
              READ DVENDITM3 FIRST RECORD INTO BUF-DVENDITM
                AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-READ
              IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" AND "10"
                 MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
              END-IF
           ELSE

      *-----  POINTER IS TOO FAR, BRING IT BACK

              IF COND-WORD = 14
                 READ DVENDITM3 NEXT RECORD INTO BUF-DVENDITM
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       851-BACK-VENDOR.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD, NO-NEXT.
           READ DVENDITM PRIOR RECORD INTO BUF-DVENDITM
               AT END MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
                   MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF VENCDE OF DVENDITM-REC NOT = VENDOR-ARG
               MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
               ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
               MOVE IO-REL-NO TO RELATIVE-KEY.

      *-----  IF READ TOOK POINTER BEYOND BEGINNING OF FILE
