           IF REQNO OF DVENDITM-REC4 NOT = REQ-ARG
               MOVE 14 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
               ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
               MOVE IO-REL-NO TO RELATIVE-KEY.

      *-----  IF READ TOOK POINTER BEYOND BEGINNING OF FILE
      *-----  DO READ FIRST TO BRING POINTER BACK.

           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
              READ DVENDITM4 FIRST RECORD INTO BUF-DVENDITM
                AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-READ
              IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" AND "10"
                 MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
              END-IF
           ELSE

      *-----  POINTER IS TOO FAR, BRING IT BACK

