128700 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE1
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE2
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE3.
