048600 949-EXIT.  EXIT.
204300 990-BLOWUP.
204400     MOVE QUOTE-ARG       TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
204500     MOVE CODE-ARG        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
204600     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
